Dialogue: 4,0:18:07.98,0:18:10.78,Dreading Parfait Insert2 - Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's make dreams! We can do it!
Dialogue: 4,0:18:10.78,0:18:13.41,Dreading Parfait Insert2 - Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's make dreams! Change my world!
Dialogue: 4,0:18:13.41,0:18:17.08,Dreading Parfait Insert2 - Eng,,0,0,0,,There's no turning back once we start
Dialogue: 4,0:18:18.58,0:18:24.08,Dreading Parfait Insert2 - Eng,,0,0,0,,Looking for a new world, and I know we'll find one
Dialogue: 4,0:18:24.08,0:18:29.25,Dreading Parfait Insert2 - Eng,,0,0,0,,Once we start having fun I just know we can't stop
Dialogue: 4,0:18:29.25,0:18:33.84,Dreading Parfait Insert2 - Eng,,0,0,0,,As long as we're together I can dance too
Dialogue: 4,0:18:33.84,0:18:36.72,Dreading Parfait Insert2 - Eng,,0,0,0,,The door of dreams
Dialogue: 4,0:18:36.72,0:18:42.18,Dreading Parfait Insert2 - Eng,,0,0,0,,It will open for the three of us, I believe it will
Dialogue: 4,0:18:42.18,0:18:44.52,Dreading Parfait Insert2 - Eng,,0,0,0,,So here we go
Dialogue: 4,0:18:44.52,0:18:46.19,Dreading Parfait Insert2 - Eng,,0,0,0,,Our secret passion
Dialogue: 4,0:18:46.19,0:18:50.53,Dreading Parfait Insert2 - Eng,,0,0,0,,Will turn our "run-of-the-mill" into miracles
Dialogue: 4,0:18:50.53,0:18:51.86,Dreading Parfait Insert2 - Eng,,0,0,0,,Come on along
Dialogue: 4,0:18:51.86,0:18:52.94,Dreading Parfait Insert2 - Eng,,0,0,0,,Come on
Dialogue: 4,0:18:52.94,0:18:56.66,Dreading Parfait Insert2 - Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,400)}To our magical PARTY TIME
Dialogue: 4,0:18:58.24,0:19:01.41,Dreading Parfait Insert2 - Eng,,0,0,0,,You and me, we all have one
Dialogue: 4,0:19:01.41,0:19:03.96,Dreading Parfait Insert2 - Eng,,0,0,0,,A place where we can really shine
Dialogue: 4,0:19:03.96,0:19:05.21,Dreading Parfait Insert2 - Eng,,0,0,0,,Want to change things?
Dialogue: 4,0:19:05.21,0:19:06.42,Dreading Parfait Insert2 - Eng,,0,0,0,,Make a wish
Dialogue: 4,0:19:06.42,0:19:07.04,Dreading Parfait Insert2 - Eng,,0,0,0,,Look for it
Dialogue: 4,0:19:07.04,0:19:08.92,Dreading Parfait Insert2 - Eng,,0,0,0,,A feeling from deep within
Dialogue: 4,0:19:08.92,0:19:09.59,Dreading Parfait Insert2 - Eng,,0,0,0,,Make it true
Dialogue: 4,0:19:09.59,0:19:11.96,Dreading Parfait Insert2 - Eng,,0,0,0,,The true smile you hid
Dialogue: 4,0:19:11.96,0:19:13.34,Dreading Parfait Insert2 - Eng,,0,0,0,,Can't be held back anymore
Dialogue: 4,0:19:13.34,0:19:14.76,Dreading Parfait Insert2 - Eng,,0,0,0,,No one can
Dialogue: 4,0:19:14.76,0:19:16.72,Dreading Parfait Insert2 - Eng,,0,0,0,,Give in to the passion and
Dialogue: 4,0:19:16.72,0:19:17.22,Dreading Parfait Insert2 - Eng,,0,0,0,,Sing! Sing!
Dialogue: 4,0:19:17.22,0:19:19.85,Dreading Parfait Insert2 - Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's sing together
Dialogue: 4,0:19:19.85,0:19:25.48,Dreading Parfait Insert2 - Eng,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,500)}I'm changing! My way!
